title: biosspheres
type: software
version: 0.2.0
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/iamartineza/biosspheres"
abstract: >-
  Laplace and Helmholtz boundary integral operators on multiple disjoint
  spheres in a spherical harmonic basis, the local multiple traces
  formulation for transmission problems, and its coupling with ordinary
  differential equations in time.
keywords:
  - boundary integral equations
  - multiple traces formulation
  - spherical harmonics
  - Laplace
  - Helmholtz
